/// \class UntamedAllegianceSpecialPower
/// \ingroup grp_w1021_special_power_factories_more
/// \brief Special power module registered as
///        "UntamedAllegianceSpecialPower", with no settings beyond the
///        shared special-power fields.
///
/// A SpecialPowerModule subclass with no per-object storage of its own.
/// It replaces a virtual per-target step that SpecialPowerModule
/// declares. A target with a particular
/// status flag set is left alone. Otherwise the step runs
/// SpecialPowerModule's version, passes the module's own object to an
/// Object function on the target that this page does not identify, calls
/// a second such function on the target, records the module's own object
/// as the target's producer (Object::setProducer) and clears another
/// status flag on the target (Object::setStatus with its set argument
/// false). The whole reads as taking the target over, but because this
/// page does not identify the two functions, that reading is not
/// confirmed here.
///
/// \par Modding
/// INI fields: the special-power table only; the class's own table is
/// empty.
/// \see UntamedAllegianceSpecialPower::friend_newModuleInstance,
///      UntamedAllegianceSpecialPowerModuleData::friend_newModuleData

/// \fn Module *UntamedAllegianceSpecialPower::friend_newModuleInstance(Thing *thing, const ModuleData *moduleData)
/// \brief Instance factory registered for "UntamedAllegianceSpecialPower":
///        creates the module for one object.
///
/// Same pattern as CombineHordeSpecialPower::friend_newModuleInstance.
///
/// \param thing       The object being built.
/// \param moduleData  The template's module data.
/// \return The new module, as the Module base the factory stores.
/// \see UntamedAllegianceSpecialPowerModuleData::friend_newModuleData

/// \class UntamedAllegianceSpecialPowerModuleData
/// \ingroup grp_w1021_special_power_factories_more
/// \brief Module data for UntamedAllegianceSpecialPower: the shared
///        special-power fields only.
